 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to the United States increased from 323.6 million euros in 2005 to 421.0 million euros in 2025, a rise of 30.1%.",
  "Imports from the United States grew from 572.4 million euros in 2005 to 638.1 million euros in 2025, an increase of 11.5%.",
  "The largest export increase between consecutive years was from 261.9 million euros in 2010 to 395.4 million euros in 2011, while imports peaked at 1.76 billion euros in 2012 after rising sharply from 1.08 billion euros in 2011.",
  "Exports reached their highest value in 2023 at 508.3 million euros, and imports had their highest values in 2012 and 2015, which together accounted for 18.7% of total imports over the period.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for inflation or price changes."
 ],
